  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Our traditional Ye&apos;kwana lands</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To promote the autonomy of the Ye&apos;kwana people and the strengthening of the SEDUUME Association through the generation of income from the sustainable exploration of native cocoa and the enhancement of knowledge and the Ye&apos;kwana way of life; the well-being of the Ye&apos;kwana people depends on the performance of ritual practices and the execution of ancestral songs, as well as on the integrity of their territory.</narrative>
  </description>
